-- 0015_social_press_enrichment
-- Enrichment from the institution's own social channels and the national
-- press coverage of the retrospective's inauguration (extracted 2026-11-19
-- from @bodhisattvagallery / Bodhisattva Gallery on Facebook, and from
-- The Himalayan Times, Online Khabar and The Rising Nepal, 16-17 Nov 2026;
-- plan reviewed with ChatGPT, Gemini and Claude before implementation --
-- see docs/SOCIAL_PRESS_UPDATE.md).
--
-- Scope (data only; the one code change is the footer reading the new
-- social_* settings):
--   1. Three new press clippings for the inauguration (archive 20 -> 23).
--      Each carries an editorial summary written for this archive, the
--      outlet's own photograph of the ceremony (supplied by the gallery
--      to the press), and the external URL of the original article; the
--      outlets' article text is NOT reproduced. The 2022 Kathmandu Post
--      feature remains the featured item.
--   2. Retrospective record: inauguration account + visit facts (daily
--      12-7, Rs 200 entry matched by the institution to the Prime
--      Minister's Disaster Relief Fund, Sunday 4 PM artist tours).
--   3. Babu Kaji Bajracharya record: the gallery's artist-support model
--      (works bought outright; five per cent of sale prices added to the
--      artist; his wife felicitated), as published by the gallery itself.
--   4. The 2016 Embodied Enlightenment record points forward to the
--      2026 retrospective.
--   5. Museum timeline: collecting begins in 1986 (the founder's own
--      anniversary post); About history gains the 1986 sentence and the
--      WOW Magazine 'Collectors with Vision' line (Dec 2025); Foundation
--      mission gains the July 2026 Golden Temple donation (NPR 400,005).
--   6. site_settings: social_instagram / social_facebook (public). The
--      footer renders only profiles that are set; social_youtube stays
--      unset until the official channel URL is confirmed.
-- Images are served from the frontend's public/images/news/ (committed
-- with this migration). Rollback: 0015_social_press_enrichment_down.sql.

--> statement-breakpoint
